      "content": "thanks. can you go deeper into that last one though? the part about identity and collective responsibility. like, what's the actual philosophical or legal logic used by people who say current generations shouldn't be held responsible for what their ancestors did? i want to make sure i'm not misrepresenting their logic in my post.",
